{"id":"capable","lemma":"capable","pos":"adj","rank":692,"glosses":["able, capable"],"ipa":"/ka.pabl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/Fr-capable.ogg/Fr-capable.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"capables"},"formAudio":{"capables":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-capables.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le bébé est capable de marcher.","en":"The baby is able to walk.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to walk"}]},{"text":"Je sais de quoi ils sont capables.","en":"I know what they're capable of.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},null,null,{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what was that"]]},{"text":"Serais-je capable de le faire ?","en":"Could I do it?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Sont-ils capables de lire ces mots ?","en":"Are they able to read these words?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to read"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"word","l":"mot"}]},{"text":"Je sais ce dont je suis capable.","en":"I know what I'm capable of.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"of/from whom/which"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null]}]}